training-label means. H20/execute10 is configurable. Full held-out flow loss is
logged every250; sampled per-dimension L1 and gripper sign accuracy (all/open)
every500 on two evenly spaced held-out batches. Logs include element counts and
null when no open label exists. Samples used for L1 are continuous before
controller clipping/sign conversion.

